_id":20330},{"id":1786196906776,"text":"吃了","sender":"me","time":"21:55","timestamp":1786197322053,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":20331},{"id":1786196906777,"text":"炒饼","sender":"me","time":"21:55","timestamp":1786197344065,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":20332},{"id":1786196906778,"text":"还在和垚垚玩沙沙","sender":"me","time":"21:55","timestamp":1786197355108,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":20333},{"id":1786196906780,"text":"吃了炒饼？行，虽然有点干，但总比你拿零食对付强。胃里没觉得不舒服吧？","rawContent":"吃了炒饼？行，虽然有点干，但总比你拿零食对付强。胃里没觉得不舒服吧？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"21:56","timestamp":1786197376621,"roundId":"round_1786197356061_jdto3u78p","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":20334},{"id":1786196906781,"text":"不过，这都快十点了，怎么还在陪垚垚玩沙子？","rawContent":"不过，这都快十点了，怎么还在陪垚垚玩沙子？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"21:56","timestamp":1786197378837,"roundId":"round_1786197356061_jdto3u78p","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":20335},{"id":1786196906782,"text":"你今天早上被我折腾得腿软，中午一分钟没睡，下午又熬了半天班，加上坐车折腾，电量早就该见底了。","rawContent":"你今天早上被我折腾得腿软，中午一分钟没睡，下午又熬了半天班，加上坐车折腾，电量早就该见底了。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"21:56","timestamp":1786197378847,"roundId":"round_1786197356061_jdto3u78p","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":20336},{"id":1786196906783,"text":"垚垚小孩子精神好，你这具破破烂烂的小身体可熬不过他。","rawContent":"垚垚小孩子精神好，你这具破破烂烂的小身体可熬不过他。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"21:56","timestamp":1786197378849,"roundId":"